  "ja436:0.4": "436. Samuggajātakaṃ (10) 87. ",
  "ja436:1.1": "Kuto nu āgacchatha bho tayo janā, ",
  "ja436:1.2": "svāgatā etha nisīdathāsane; ",
  "ja436:1.3": "Kaccittha bhonto kusalaṃ anāmayaṃ, ",
  "ja436:1.4": "cirassamabbhāgamanaṃ hi vo idha. ",
  "ja436:2.1": "88. Ahameva eko idha majja patto, ",
  "ja436:2.2": "na cāpi me dutiyo koci vijjati; ",
  "ja436:2.3": "Kimeva sandhāya te bhāsitaṃ ise, ",
  "ja436:2.4": "‘‘kuto nu āgacchatha bho tayo janā’’. ",
  "ja436:3.1": "89. Tuvañca eko bhariyā ca te piyā, ",
  "ja436:3.2": "samuggapakkhittanikiṇṇamantare; ",
  "ja436:3.3": "Sā rakkhitā kucchigatāva te sadā, ",
  "ja436:3.4": "vāyussa puttena sahā tahiṃ ratā. ",
  "ja436:4.1": "90. Saṃviggarūpo isinā viyākato , ",
  "ja436:4.2": "so dānavo tattha samuggamuggili; ",
  "ja436:4.3": "Addakkhi bhariyaṃ suci māladhāriniṃ, ",
  "ja436:4.4": "vāyussa puttena sahā tahiṃ rataṃ. ",
  "ja436:5.1": "91. Sudiṭṭharūpamuggatapānuvattinā , ",
  "ja436:5.2": "hīnā narā ye pamadāvasaṃ gatā; ",
  "ja436:5.3": "Yathā have pāṇarivettha rakkhitā, ",
  "ja436:5.4": "duṭṭhā mayī aññamabhippamodayi. ",
  "ja436:6.1": "92. Divā ca ratto ca mayā upaṭṭhitā, ",
  "ja436:6.2": "tapassinā jotirivā vane vasaṃ; ",
  "ja436:6.3": "Sā dhammamukkamma adhammamācari, ",
  "ja436:6.4": "akiriyarūpo pamadāhi santhavo. ",
  "ja436:7.1": "93. Sarīramajjhamhi ṭhitātimaññahaṃ, ",
  "ja436:7.2": "mayhaṃ ayanti asatiṃ asaññataṃ; ",
  "ja436:7.3": "Sā dhammamukkamma adhammamācari, ",
  "ja436:7.4": "akiriyarūpo pamadāhi santhavo. ",
  "ja436:8.1": "94. Surakkhitaṃ meti kathaṃ nu vissase, ",
  "ja436:8.2": "anekacittāsu na hatthi rakkhaṇā; ",
  "ja436:8.3": "Etā hi pātālapapātasannibhā, ",
  "ja436:8.4": "etthappamatto byasanaṃ nigacchati. ",
  "ja436:9.1": "95. Tasmā hi te sukhino vītasokā, ",
  "ja436:9.2": "ye mātugāmehi caranti nissaṭā; ",
  "ja436:9.3": "Etaṃ sivaṃ uttamamābhipatthayaṃ, ",
  "ja436:9.4": "na mātugāmehi kareyya santhavanti. ",
  "ja436:10.1": "Samuggajātakaṃ dasamaṃ. "
}
